{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1244246542"}, "name":{"label":"anonymousabc13205856777"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-22T07:20:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.81.0"}, "id":{"label":"11294804089"}, "title":{"label":"Absolutely fantastic!"}, "content":{"label":"This is by far one of the best apps I have ever used - does what I need it to, easy to use, and is beautifully designed! The notifications are motivational and well-timed, and the characters to earn are super cute and motivational. The UI and UX are extremely good, and everything runs smoothly with little to no bugs and glitches. I paid for the premium version which was a one time charge of £6, which is honestly by far the most worth-it App Store purchase I have ever made! This app has completely revolutionised my daily hydration, and will use this app forever! Llama Luna Apps, you should feel extremely proud of what you have created!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
