{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1460550432"}, "name":{"label":"OMS0"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-15T05:24:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.80.0"}, "id":{"label":"11161266305"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, annoying sales tactics"}, "content":{"label":"This app is great and not having any ads is a huge plus. I’m using it for 75 Hard and it performs the function I need it too. I also appreciate that the creators need to make money and I think it’s much better that they sell a lifetime premium option as apposed to a subscription but it is a predatory marketing tactic to instantly pop up with a 50% off deal that’s “only available for an hour” so you are pressured into buying it before you can even find out wether you like the app yet. I still can’t give the app less than 5 stars because even with the free version, it does exactly what I want it to do.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
