{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id101642110"}, "name":{"label":"ComeOnYouDons"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-31T10:36:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.79.0"}, "id":{"label":"11106765639"}, "title":{"label":"Best water minder app"}, "content":{"label":"Having tried many water minder apps over the years, this is hands down the best one I’ve used. Underneath the app is one of the simplest user interfaces you’ll find but it’s packed with lots of useful information and enough challenges to keep you engaged and hydrated. \n\nThanks team for allowing one time payments, not hitting us with one advert per ounce of water logged and not making it so complicated that we just give up. \n\nUnless I haven’t found out how to do it yet. I use an Apple Watch, a couple of feature requests:\n\nMy drinks order is configured in the iOS app but this is not reflected on the Apple Watch. I’d like the top ten to be my top ten on the watch for speedy entry. \n\nI also have cup sizes set in the app but when you enter on the watch you have to configure manually. Just a tap would be great!\n\nThanks again.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
